Use ModelAdmin class with list_display.

✅ CRUD Operations
32. What are CRUD operations? Mention all CRUD operations using Django views.

CRUD → Create, Read, Update, Delete.
Handled using ORM operations in views.

33. How do you update an existing record using Django ORM?
obj = Model.objects.get(id=1)
obj.field = value
obj.save()

